              "path": "SKILL.md",
              "start_line": 15,
              "end_line": 23,
              "quote": "## Architecture\n\nMemory lives in `~/coding/` with tiered structure. See `memory-template.md` for setup.\n\n```\n~/coding/\n├── memory.md      # Active preferences (≤100 lines)\n└── history.md     # Archived old preferences\n```"
            }
          ]
